OL,3,AZelensky says airlines should avoid
OL,4,ARussian airspace as Ukraine escalates
OL,5,Adrone operations
OL,6,
OL,7,FUkraine's president has told airlines
OL,8,Fthat Russian airspace will be
OL,9,F"effectively closing" as his country
OL,10,Fescalates its drone strikes.
OL,12,F"We want to warn every airline that
OL,13,Fuses Russian airspace, every insurer,
OL,14,Feveryone who still uses key Russian
OL,15,Fairports: the Russian sky is becoming
OL,16,Fcompletely dangerous," Volodymyr
OL,17,FZelensky says.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
PN,31202
SC,0002
